{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52518","headline":"其二 · 陈元光","name":"其二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一戈探虎穴，万里到龙湖。\n原上千花雨，湖边百草埔。\n分曹驱鹿豕，犄角困獐狐。\n野女妍堆髻，山獠醉倒壶。\n气清消雾冷，路险迫云衢。\n虎帐风霆肃，龙旗日月舒。\n芟除尽荆棘，雨交监湖娱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}